{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t石鼓洲旁人工島綜合廢物管理設施第1期發生三級火，暫未接獲受傷報告。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n火警發生在下午12時43分，警方接獲職員報案，消防到場，於下午1時24分將火警升為三級，動用兩條喉及兩隊煙帽隊灌救，並派出4輛救護車在場戒備。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：譚佩貞\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T06:29:43.693774+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T06:09:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T08:18:35.741728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T06:27:32.250938+00:00","content_hash":"a7eab0f9f78698b75ca1dfdde7f86eefff138e0d054708ccd8af36abb904b3ca","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}